description	"Onderonian Royalist Guards

Defensive 2-life frontline guards loyal to the crown. Has Less-Than-Lethal equipment and Riot Gear.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Military Blaster Pistol (1)
-- Mag Reload
-- 5% Faster RoF, 10% lower damage.

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (0)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"
}
